id: TRANS-001
title: TLS certificate verification disabled via environment variable
category: transport
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .mjs
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED
patterns:
  - regex: NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED.*['"]?0['"]?
    message: "TLS certificate verification disabled — enables MITM attacks"
fix: Fix the certificate chain instead of disabling verification. Use NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS to add custom CA certificates.
